# CausalIQ Governance Rules

Before planning, coding, writing tests or documentation, or running tests in
this repository, read and strictly follow the policy files in
`docs/development_policy/`:

- Planning: `docs/development_policy/00-plan.md`
- Coding: `docs/development_policy/01-code.md`
- Writing Tests: `docs/development_policy/02-test-write.md`
- Running: `docs/development_policy/03-test-run.md`
- Writing Documentation: `docs/development_policy/04-docs.md`
- Development Scripts: `docs/development_policy/05-scripts.md`

## Primary Guardrail

Never mix Feature/Fix Implementation (Hat 1) with Refactoring (Hat 2) in a
single task.

## Commits

LLMs NEVER stage, commit or push. All edits are left in the working tree for
the user to review and commit. See `docs/development_policy/00-plan.md`:

> LLMs **SHOULD NEVER** commit changes: this should remain in the control of
> the user
